m/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-09-09T10:11:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:48:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue found while developing in Godot 4.8 Dev 3\n\nTested on Godot 4.7, 4.7.1, 4.7.2, 4.8 Dev 3\n\nWorks on 4.7.1 and below.\n\nFails on 4.7.2+\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 570 Series (RADV POLARIS10) - AMD Ryzen 5 1600 Six-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.56 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nMouse motion stutters when exporting for windows from version 4.7.2 on.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a3823ec-3309-4610-bad7-ced3102cd33c\n\nHere it is working in 4.7.1 - It also works for linux and web on 4.7.2+ just not Windows.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcab20a3-ef69-45e9-88bf-4b542e9d0dc7\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n<img width=\"544\" height=\"398\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c31cae61-62c9-46f7-afc4-88dd36c156c7\" />\n\n<img width=\"277\" height=\"214\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec2fda22-bfdb-4222-99d3-e6c755a2ba1b\" />\n\n1. Add SpringArm3D with a Camera3D child\n2. Add a MeshInstance3D in front of the camera as a reference point\n3. Attach this script to SpringArm3D\n\n```gdscript\nextends SpringArm3D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_tree().root.grab_focus()\n\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n\nfunc _unhandled_key_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tprint(event.as_text())\n\tif (\n\t\tevent is InputEventKey\n\t\tand (event as InputEventKey).physical_keycode == KEY_ESCAPE\n\t):\n\t\tget_tree().quit()\n\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n\t\t#rotation_degrees.y += event.screen_relative.x * 0.05\n\t\trotation_degrees.y = fposmod(rotation_degrees.y + event.screen_relative.x * 0.05, 360.0)\n```\n\n4. Export for Windows (Project > Export)\n<img width=\"911\" height=\"548\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ef699e5-70f2-48c5-b65b-3cd6fb5a74fb\" />\n\nMy build pipeline:\n\n- Godot 4.7.2+ on Linux\n- Windows x86_64 Export Template\n- Wine-11.0 to launch the .exe from my Linux OS\n\nIt doesn’t seem to be a Wine issue, because it runs fine in earlier godot versions (4.7.1 or less), and runs fine when exported for linux. I’ve also tried running it on Proton via the Steam library and it has the same issue.\n\nLink to the forum thread: https://forum.godotengine.org/t/mouse-motion-stutters-when-exporting-for-windows-from-version-4-7-2/143977\n\nLink to the itch page including executables and browser player: https://solsticemage.itch.io/camera-test\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[camera-testbed.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32002640/camera-testbed.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123331/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123331/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}